<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: TENNIS-IVORY COAST LEAD LATVIA 3-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-IVORY COAST LEAD LATVIA 3-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast took a winning 3-0 lead over Latvia in their Davis Cup tennis Euro/African zone group two first round tie on Saturday:</p>
<p>Result of doubles match (Ivorian names first):</p>
<p>Claude N'Goran and Clement N'Goran beat Ivo Lagzdins and Raimonds Sproga 6-1 6-2 7-5</p>
</text>
